      "title": "portableapps: preserve plugins directory across upgrades",
      "message": "portableapps: preserve plugins directory across upgrades\n\nAdd a [SpecialPaths] Plugins= entry to appinfo.tmpl so the\nPortableApps.com installer preserves the global plugins directory\n(and its per-version subfolders) across upgrades instead of deleting\nit, per the PortableApps.com Format spec.Fixes #15550\n",
